#: backtrace.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not generate a backtrace as the debugger '%1' was not found."
msgstr "Ji ber pêknehatina niqandina çewtiyan %1 , dîtina paşde pêk nehat."

#: debugger.cpp:71
msgid "C&opy"
msgstr "Ji&bergirtin"

#: debugger.cpp:83
#, c-format
msgid "Application: %progname (%execname), signal %signame"
msgstr "Sepan: %progname (%execname), sînyal %signame"

#: debugger.cpp:96
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "debugging finished"
msgid "Backtrace loaded."
msgstr "Dîtina paşde"

#: debugger.cpp:121
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid "Backtrace saved to <filename>%1</filename>."
msgstr "Dîtina paşde li pelê%1 hat tomarkirin"

#: debugger.cpp:125
msgid "Cannot create a file to save the backtrace in"
msgstr "Pela tomarkirina dîtina paşde nehat afirandin"

#: debugger.cpp:133
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "Navê Pelî Hilbijêre"

#: debugger.cpp:141
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid ""
"A file named <filename>%1</filename> already exists. Are you sure you want "
"to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Bi navê \"%1\" jixwe pelek heye. Ji dil dixwazî li serê binivîsî?"

#: debugger.cpp:143
msgid "Overwrite File?"
msgstr "Li Ser Pelî Binivîse?"

#: debugger.cpp:144
msgid "&Overwrite"
msgstr "&Sernivîsandin"

#: debugger.cpp:156
#, fuzzy, kde-format
msgid "Cannot open file <filename>%1</filename> for writing."
msgstr "Pelê %1 ji bo nivîsandinê venabe"

#: debugger.cpp:164 debugger.cpp:169
msgid "Unable to create a valid backtrace."
msgstr "Dîtineke paşde nayê afiradin"

#: debugger.cpp:165 debugger.cpp:170
msgid ""
"This backtrace appears to be of no use.\n"
"This is probably because your packages are built in a way which prevents "
"creation of proper backtraces, or the stack frame was seriously corrupted in "
"the crash.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Wisa xuya ye ku ev dîtina paşde bi kar nayne.\n"
"Dibe ku ev ji ber astengiya dîtina paşde a pakêtan\\ be an jî çarçoveya "
"sergoyê xerab bûbe.\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:179
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "Dîtina paşde tê barkirin..."

#: debugger.cpp:202
msgid ""
"The following options are enabled:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Vehijêrkên li jêr hatin çalakirin:\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:204
msgid ""
"\n"
"As the usage of these options is not recommended - because they can, in rare "
"cases, be responsible for KDE problems - a backtrace will not be generated.\n"
"You need to turn these options off and reproduce the problem again in order "
"to get a backtrace.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ji ber sedema ku di hin rewşan de ji KDE'ê re pirsgirêk derdixin, bikaranîna "
"van vebijêrkan nayê pêşniyarkirin.\n"
"Ji bo dîtina paşde divê van vebijêrkan bigirî û çewtiyê ji nû ve bistînî.\n"

#: debugger.cpp:209
msgid "Backtrace will not be created."
msgstr "Dîtina paşde dê neyê afirandin."

#: debugger.cpp:220
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "Sembol tên barkirin..."

#: debugger.cpp:239
msgid "System configuration startup check disabled.\n"
msgstr "Kontrolkirina destpêkê a avakirina pergalê hat girtin.\n"

#: drbugreport.cpp:53
msgid "You have to edit the description before the report can be sent."
msgstr "Beriya şandina raporê divê ravekirinê binivîsî."

